{%- capture heading -%}{% render 'lp-copy', text: section.settings.heading %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture per_note -%}{% render 'lp-copy', text: section.settings.per_night_note %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if section.settings.enable_section -%}
<section class="lp-section lp-section--surface" id="cost-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="lp-narrow">
      <div class="lp-head lp-center">
        <p class="lp-kicker">What you are paying for</p>
        <h2>{{ heading }}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-pernight">
        <b>{{ section.settings.per_night | default: '36p a night' }}</b>
        <span>{{ per_note }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-obj">
        <details open>
          <summary>Why not one at a fifth of the price?</summary>
          <p>{% render 'lp-copy', text: 'Because you will buy it again. A cheap mattress is an annual: one life, then the whole thing goes, springs included. This is built so the part that wears comes off and the part that lasts stays. Over [Warranty] years you buy one bed and two comfort layers.' %}</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>I cannot try it first.</summary>
          <p>Neither can anyone, really. Four minutes lying down in a shop tells you nothing about the eighth week. That is why the feel is not fixed when you order: you sleep on it, and for a year we remake the comfort layer until it is right.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>I have never heard of you.</summary>
          <p>Fair. So we made the things that usually stay hidden checkable: every one of the 13 layers, the wire gauges, the densities, the zone map. And 100 nights to send it back, collected from your home, refunded in full.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What if the firmness is wrong?</summary>
          <p>Turn the layer over. One face is medium, the other medium firm, and they are equal halves rather than a token flip. If neither is yours, tell us how it should feel and we build one to that description.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Will it sag like the last one?</summary>
          <p>{% render 'lp-copy', text: 'Sagging is the comfort layer, not the springs. On a sealed mattress that means the whole thing is finished. Here the comfort layer is a part, and the 8cm encased perimeter and [Warranty]-year [Core] underneath are not going anywhere.' %}</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What happens to my old mattress?</summary>
          <p>It leaves on the same visit and goes for recycling. Complimentary, and it is why nothing of ours has to end in landfill either.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is it actually better, or just more expensive?</summary>
          <p>Ask a simpler question: what happens in year eight? On a sealed mattress, you buy another one. Here you buy a {{ settings.refit_price | default: '£299' }} layer. That is the difference, and it is structural rather than a matter of taste.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      <p class="lp-cta"><a class="btn" href="#configure">Choose your size</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Landing why it costs",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_section", "label": "Show this section", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "[Warranty] years of good mornings." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "per_night", "label": "Per-night figure", "default": "36p a night" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "per_night_note", "label": "Per-night note", "default": "A super king over its [Warranty]-year guarantee. A [Refit] at year 5 and year 10 adds about 7p." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Landing why it costs" }]
}
{% endschema %}
